NOTE ON BRAND ASSETS

The Buccellati name, "BUCCELLATI" wordmark, "Since 1919" lockup, B monogram,
the tulle / rigato / segrinato / telato / ornato / modellato craft vocabulary,
the Macri / Rombi / Tulle / Eternelle collection names, and any official
brand assets remain the intellectual property of Buccellati and Compagnie
Financière Richemont SA.

Nothing in this repository or the MIT License above grants any right to those
assets. The SVG ornaments in `assets/svg/` are reference drawings derived
from publicly observable Buccellati visual language; they are NOT a substitute
for the official brand assets and must be replaced with the Maison's licensed
files for any external-facing production use.
